    "companyProfile": "zvoove Clean is zvoove Group's cleaning division (CEO Stefan Kramer), stating 2,500+ customers, 250,000 cleaners on zvoove platforms and 15+ countries. It combines fortytools (DE, 1,200+ customers), KleanApp (DE, acquired March 2026, used by 7 of the top 20 German facility companies), CleanManager (DK/DE/UK, 425+ customers and 15,000 users, acquired August 2025), adata (DE payroll, ~450 customers, acquired October 2025), Leviy (NL, 150+ companies, acquired 2019/2021), Nocore (NL cleaning ERP, acquired May 2025) and Freematica's cleaning users (ES/LatAm).",
    "operatingModel": "Modeled: brand teams remain close to their customers while shared teams build the integrated planning-to-payroll platform that zvoove Clean describes. Team names are illustrative."
